• Send: share a note through an encrypted link that expires.
• Attachments: add files to items, then open or save them.
• Emergency access: someone you trust can ask for view-only access after a wait you choose.
• Signed sharing: shared vaults are checked against the sharer's signature; a vault added without an invitation waits for your OK.
• Editing no longer drops attached files.
Needs PassAuth server 0.12.0.
